cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the application, engine, method hash and source revision used for your run. This source package does not claim independent scientific validation."
title: "MVS Analyzer: sensitivity of repeated-measurement summaries and model-based variance analysis"
abstract: >-
  MVS Analyzer provides empirical sensitivity calibration for entity summaries,
  Gaussian within/between variance-component analysis, known-truth estimation
  studies, and an optional experimental mixed-effects location-scale model.
  Public application 1.4.0 uses engine 1.6.0. Inference and numerical assumptions
  are documented; local checksums do not establish scientific validity.
type: software
